{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/cor-descartes-braid-structure","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Corollary","doco:Section"],"label":"cor:descartes-braid-structure","kind":"corollary","title":"Braid-group structure of a Descartes universe","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-braid-action-tensor","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-color-sector-coords","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-r-matrix-braiding","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-trefoil-operator-algebra","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-brings-is-qou","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-p-adic-realisation"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-descartes-braid-structure"],"tags":["archimedean-universe","braid-group","dic3"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.descartes_braid_structure","text":"descartes-braid-structure.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes-braid-structure.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"cor:descartes-braid-structure\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a Descartes universe (<a href=\"#def:archimedean-condition\">Descartes condition</a>). Then:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>The braiding of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C} = \\mathrm{Rep}(\\mathrm{SU}_q(2))</code> induces a faithful representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho_3\\colon B_3 \\to \\mathrm{Aut}_{\\mathbf{C}}(V^{\\otimes 3})</code> on the fundamental representation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">V</code> (<a href=\"#prop:braid-action-tensor\">braid action on tensor products</a>).</li>\n<li>The image of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho_3</code> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{SU}(2)</code> (via the fibre functor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau</code>) is the binary dihedral group <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Dic}_3</code> of order <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">12</code> (<a href=\"#def:su2-generators\">SU(2) generators</a>).</li>\n<li>The composite <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">B_3 \\xrightarrow{\\rho_3} \\mathrm{Dic}_3 \\twoheadrightarrow S_3</code> recovers the three copies of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_3</code> inside <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_5 = \\mathrm{Aut}(\\Sigma_4)</code> (<a href=\"#rem:chirality-trefoil\">chirality and trefoil</a>), mapping one to each colour sector.</li>\n</ol>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes-braid-structure.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Corollary","number":"7.8.15"}
